{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，一款體積異常龐大的AMD PCIe顯卡原型在網絡上曝光，引發硬件愛好者關注。從電路板上清晰可見的AMD標識來看，這是一款來自AMD的產品設計，其誕生時間很可能處於Polaris架構時期。不過，與當年面向消費者市場的顯卡不同，這款產品採用了極為少見的四GPU方案，在AMD公開發布的產品線中從未正式出現過。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584870.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.040603+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:33:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.353581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.353581+00:00","content_hash":"04402480a66c1c61e7e267b7d7773fbfcf05c2faf1e574573fdc750b2b3a57a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}